{
  "title": "Exotic Smoky Brazilian Boudin Blanc Skewers",
  "description": "A mustardy and festive Brazilian dish featuring boudin blanc, binchotan charcoal, and gluten free friendly ingredients, perfect for outdoor gatherings.",
